{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>從實測畫面來看，使用iPhone Duo內屏運行《王者榮耀》時，遊戲無法全屏顯示，僅支持等比例縮放，即使將畫面放大，上下依然留有明顯黑邊，被網友調侃是「廣告位招租」。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1025/c24b1ec2badbbdf.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1025/4fbcf1f3a03528d.png\">\n</p>\n<p>不僅如此，使用外屏玩《王者榮耀》同樣存在適配問題，遊戲畫面無法鋪滿屏幕，上半部分留有大片黑邊。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1025/31913967b163f3d.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1025/38ad45752b875d9.png\">\n</p>\n<p>知名帶貨主播李佳琦也在直播中談到了iPhone Duo的軟件適配問題，直言「95%不適配」。</p>\n<p>李佳琦吐槽道：「哇塞，我的《王者榮耀》打開這麼一點，我的大拇指放上去都按不到按鈕。」</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1025/1da6f4fdd8411d2.png\">\n</p>\n<p>李佳琦還建議暫時先別買iPhone Duo，不用急着第一波加價入手，可以再等一等。</p>\n<p>據了解，蘋果在App Store中專門展示針對iPhone Duo完成優化的應用。</p>\n<p>目前，適配名單包括愛奇藝、騰訊視頻、QQ音樂、QQ、DeepSeek、京東、WPS Office、高德地圖、支付寶等、開心消消樂App。</p>\n<p>不過，從首批用户的實際體驗來看，iPhone Duo的軟件生態仍有待完善，尤其是《王者榮耀》等熱門遊戲的適配問題，還需要後續版本更新解決。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1025/29933a4eaa38e73.png\">\n</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:03.026764+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":444,"images":6,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T07:04:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:05.387312+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:42.208313+00:00","content_hash":"6ad40c34c17f88cc9914f55dac557cfb10d16ce6328c387bc294454f90c3d5aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:03.026764+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}